        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow4:129",
        "answer": "Returns false for a non-arena entry; true for the disabling dvar or non-LAN without an arena season; otherwise false. This is a menu gate, not a whole-mode relevance exclusion. Starts with IsMatchmakingInProgress. Only while true does it check the main mode: Warzone forces false, other modes use not ShowDirectorPrivate(nil,controller). Returns the resulting value. Calls ZombieUtility.ZMOfflineNavigateToCustomGames with the second argument only when the ZombieUtility table exists. The actual call is preserved as a shared helper boundary, not authoring unrelated-mode internals. If either hashed engine predicate is true, only mode_warzone is available. Otherwise availability means GetDisplayNameForEMode is not hash_0. Traverses the supplied widget model→info get value→selectedCharacterType. When that child exists, requests update_frozen_moment_character with its index get value; absent link [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
